<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: TENNIS-IVORY COAST BEAT LATVIA 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IVORY COAST BEAT LATVIA 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast completed a 5-0 victory over Latvia after winning both reverse singles in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results: Ilou Lonfo beat Raimonds Sproga  6-1 6-2 Sanou Valentin beat Ivo Lagzdins 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
